00:12:36.409 --> 00:12:38.946
- [Gary] This is amazing, huh?
- [DRock] No, Gary.

00:12:38.946 --> 00:12:40.612
- I know what I can eat.

00:12:40.612 --> 00:12:42.612
Ham, turkey sandwich, right?

00:12:42.612 --> 00:12:45.468
- [DRock] I don't know
why you are asking me.

00:12:45.468 --> 00:12:47.513
You said, "No, Gary," before.

00:12:47.513 --> 00:12:49.285
- [DRock] You're
going to go for dessert.

00:12:49.285 --> 00:12:50.459
- [Gary] No, I was not.

00:12:50.459 --> 00:12:53.460
There's so much I could say
there's so many feelings you

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:57.508
have when you're building
something but I'm personally

00:12:57.508 --> 00:13:01.391
very excited about where we
stand and where we're going.

00:13:01.391 --> 00:13:03.922
I'm excited about this group
that's here and I'm excited

00:13:03.922 --> 00:13:05.864
about the groups coming over 
to Hudson Yards and

00:13:05.864 --> 00:13:07.359
where we're going.

00:13:07.359 --> 00:13:10.952
We can do this because were
more talented than everybody.

00:13:12.522 --> 00:13:15.458
The reason we can be this is
'cause we are more talented.

00:13:15.458 --> 00:13:16.773
We're just better.

00:13:16.773 --> 00:13:18.062
We're going to win anyway.

00:13:18.062 --> 00:13:20.051
We can win being
nice to each other.

00:13:20.051 --> 00:13:21.768
It's just going to happen.

00:13:21.768 --> 00:13:24.103
The legacy of what we're 
building is real.

00:13:24.103 --> 00:13:26.361
And it drives me the most.

00:13:26.361 --> 00:13:30.338
And I'm really really, really,
really glad that we get

00:13:30.338 --> 00:13:31.921
to do it together.

00:13:31.921 --> 00:13:33.279
I love you guys, thank you.

00:13:33.279 --> 00:13:36.577
(applause)

00:13:36.577 --> 00:13:39.917
(light music)

